Material not covered by this notice
-----------------------------------

Collection records and images belong to the museums that hold the
objects and remain subject to each museum's own terms:

- National Museum of Korea: images recorded as KOGL Type 1
  (Korea Open Government License, attribution required).
- The Palace Museum, Beijing: images are linked from its official
  website; no licence is recorded in this dataset.
- Victoria and Albert Museum, London: images are shown under the V&A's
  terms of use for non-commercial purposes.
- The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York: images designated public
  domain (CC0) under its Open Access policy.

Third-party files keep their own licences:

- vendor/globe.gl.min.js: Globe.gl (https://github.com/vasturiano/globe.gl),
  under its own licence.
- img/earth-blue-marble.jpg: taken from the three-globe examples
  (https://github.com/vasturiano/three-globe), under the terms of its source.

For permission requests, contact the copyright holder through the
repository owner on GitHub.
